{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c99bbe74cccdc92b249d376f13d9429d41a8b7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b0ef36e96718723e74fe27c167a9992de7e7d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=40^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is within the triangle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/8/3e8b04ea3f7bf474ce6e7fa4b6bd971577ecf782.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OBC \\cong \\angle OCA$\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" />. \nThe number of degrees in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4fff693c9a4aff817b05b712cd2376cd1673c08d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d40be2597a7b39a4e8e817be5eb6c5199570d119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 110^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 35^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 140^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 55^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 70^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"449\" height=\"17\" />     \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is an isosceles triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/c/0bc385ccab302df9b460a9213e0efd47b8e9da7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = \\angle ACB = 70^{\\circ}$\" width=\"183\" height=\"13\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/7/dd73af21ba68050967dfdb9290328dae14d21dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OBC = \\angle OCA = x$\" width=\"170\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509ddeaba79a27d52ab77a8da9cfebd19c300e91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB = 70$\" width=\"97\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/1/9f1f1087a323b59b4c29292f73129b960ba44e7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OCB = 70 - x$\" width=\"131\" height=\"12\" />. The angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f820b345347a6b0b992f9441716d66c2a6bdf5bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle OBC$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/478e61df333e239ab43596b96e46a39d275ee00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOC = 180 - (x + 70 - x) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 110^{\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"334\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 5